From fb483d51ea19b4c6d4e789aff6b59030ea48a149 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Fri, 23 Oct 2026 18:34:41 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 1/2] Add VoiceStudio as a premium narration engine

flow_narrate gains engine "voicestudio": the free VoiceStudio app on this
computer, with saved cloned or designed voices, engine and built-in voice
choice, language, personality, speed, quality, steps, guidance, seed,
finishing effect, denoise, exact length, bit depth and pronunciation, and
scripts up to 20,000 characters. New tools flow_voice_clone and
flow_voice_design; flow_voices reports VoiceStudio's status and options.
Flow Studio's Voice tab gets the same controls plus clone and design forms.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01UYtyHy26v1e6uPSVEQ6Wzb
