From 01b9981ac41144c2c384fd2061454dbdf09b896b Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Fri, 23 Oct 2026 19:21:03 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 2/2] Add the Drama Studio: a whole micro-drama from a title
 and an idea

Writes the script (Claude, OpenAI, Gemini or Claude in chat), draws the cast and
a frame per shot (Flow, Gemini, OpenAI, fal.ai, OpenRouter), voices every line
(VoiceStudio, Google, local, ElevenLabs, OpenAI), animates each frame (Flow,
fal.ai, Google, Runway, Kling, Higgsfield), adds sound and music (ElevenLabs),
and cuts the vertical episode with captions. Keys are saved from the panel
only. Paid steps need an approved amount; anything made is kept and any item
can be redone. New flow_drama_* tools and a Drama tab in Flow Studio.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01UYtyHy26v1e6uPSVEQ6Wzb
